00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
Don’t say: I am agree with you.

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:05,600
Say: I agree with you.

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:08,400
Wrong: I am agree with you.

4
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:11,200
Correct: I agree with you.

5
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:14,000
Quick rule:

6
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,800
Agree is a verb, so do not use am before it.

